Amazon Renewed aggregates third-party refurbished product sales with standardized quality tiers (Premium, Excellent, Good, Acceptable) and 90+ day warranty requirements. Sellers must demonstrate USD 50k-2.5M qualifying refurbished purchases in prior 90-180 days to qualify; all products undergo diagnostic testing, faulty part replacement, thorough cleaning. Extended warranties via Asurion available for select categories. Amazon Renewed operates as discovery + trust layer, enabling SME refurbishers to reach scale audiences while leveraging Amazon's return infrastructure and reputation management.